From: Alberto Cavalcante <54247214+albertocavalcante@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Feb 2026 04:30:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add OnExec callback for coverage instrumentation

Add Thread.OnExec callback invoked before each bytecode instruction.
This enables coverage collection, debugging, and tracing use cases.

Changes:
- Thread.OnExec field in eval.go
- Callback invocation in interp.go interpreter loop
- Function.PositionAt(pc) method in value.go to resolve source position
- Tests demonstrating coverage collection pattern

TODO(upstream): trim verbose comments to match codebase style before proposing.
